{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MOSH</strong> is a game that removes the tactical nature of a first-person shooter and replaces it with <strong>high-speed movement</strong> and <strong>close-range combos</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MOSH</strong> replaces health bars with a <strong>percentage-based launch mechanic</strong>. As enemies take hits, their percentage climbs, making them easier to knock offstage.<br><br><strong>If an enemy touches the border of a stage, they will explode.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436590/extras/bc592b60219817c864a8fc62b8101d05.poster.avif?t=1767847237\" width=1170 height=410 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436590/extras/bc592b60219817c864a8fc62b8101d05.webm?t=1767847237\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436590/extras/bc592b60219817c864a8fc62b8101d05.mp4?t=1767847237\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i> </i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join a group of up to <strong>8</strong> <strong>people</strong>, assemble a kit of abilities and tools, and fight solo or in teams across 30 different stages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436590/extras/6c86dd0b7a99ed1cf235d33da99fa491.poster.avif?t=1767847237\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_ass